From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Hunter B Hough <git@hough.ink>
Date: Mon, 7 Sep 2026 13:50:56 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 84/91] style(ci): make the nightly's gating expression an
 explicit folded scalar (gcp-oz57)

Self-review touch-up. Both gated steps in supported-pack-nightly.yml carried
their two-clause condition as an implicit multi-line plain scalar, with the
continuation line starting `&&`. That parses correctly -- verified -- but it
reads like two separate keys at a glance, and the failure mode if someone later
edits it wrong is silent: a condition that lost its second clause still parses,
still passes a substring check, and simply stops skipping anything.

`if: >-` states the folding outright. No behavioural change; the folded value is
byte-identical, and the YAML-parsing assertion in
test_manifold_dependent_steps_are_gated_on_the_detection_step compares against
that value rather than the source text, so it covers either spelling.

patches/ re-exported for the amended 0083.
---
 .github/workflows/supported-pack-nightly.yml | 6 ++++--
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/.github/workflows/supported-pack-nightly.yml b/.github/workflows/supported-pack-nightly.yml
index ba858f1..62d52fd 100644
--- a/.github/workflows/supported-pack-nightly.yml
+++ b/.github/workflows/supported-pack-nightly.yml
@@ -255,7 +255,8 @@ jobs:
         run: .github/scripts/install-gascity-archive.sh "${GASCITY_REF}" --cache
 
       - name: Validate Manifold Claude configuration
-        if: steps.subset.outputs.run_gate == 'true'
+        if: >-
+          steps.subset.outputs.run_gate == 'true'
           && steps.manifold.outputs.present == 'true'
         run: |
           test -n "$OLLAMA_API_KEY" || { echo "Missing OLLAMA_API_KEY GitHub secret" >&2; exit 1; }
@@ -274,7 +275,8 @@ jobs:
           printf 'GC_INFERENCE_EXPECTED_MODEL=%s\n' "$GC_INFERENCE_EXPECTED_MODEL"
 
       - name: Run supported-pack nightly inference gate
-        if: steps.subset.outputs.run_gate == 'true'
+        if: >-
+          steps.subset.outputs.run_gate == 'true'
           && steps.manifold.outputs.present == 'true'
         env:
           GATE_TIMEOUT: ${{ github.event.inputs.timeout || matrix.gate_timeout }}
-- 
